codex
The fresh result mutation compiled cleanly and then failed on the expected residual (`Bool(true)` could not satisfy `Bool(false)`), so the theorem is not vacuous. The decisive defect is narrower: the proof is discriminating and body-pinned, but it proves the body under a call semantics that changes the real program’s observable behavior on an unrestricted valid input.
